{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n「最強CP」林淑敏與許家傑正式加盟節目《愛．回家之三代同糖》，昨日（16日）官方曝光的宣傳片卻驚見二人關係180度逆轉！影片中兩人隔空互數，火藥味濃，但轉頭竟被發現在暗角激烈擁吻，場面極度震撼，究竟二人關係是龍是鳳？\n</p>\n<h2>慌張西望神還原 許家傑咆哮狂數林淑敏</h2>\n<p>宣傳短片神還原《東張西望》經典採訪模式，不但配上標誌性緊張配樂，更為林淑敏與許家傑的容貌「打格」，營造爆料懸疑感。過往在《愛．回家之開心速遞》中暖男形象深入民心的許家傑，今次化身霸總「宋銳威」竟火力全開，對著鏡頭激動咆哮：「我唔會同佢結婚」、「我嘅底線就係……我最唔鍾意俾人篤魂精㗎喇，大小姐！」句句針對「戴嘉婷」（林淑敏飾），與昔日寵溺「大小姐」的「送水輝」判若兩人。</p>\n<h2>林淑敏大小姐上身反擊 激動狂拋金句</h2>\n<p>面對許家傑的指控，向來霸氣的林淑敏當然不甘示弱，即時連珠炮發反擊，更一度激動得「大小姐」上身：「我姓戴，唔係大小姐呀」、「嗰個婆娘有咩好呀？」她更拋出經典金句，怒斥對方是「人頭豬」，更揚言：「豈有此理」、「我要篤爆佢魂精呀！」雙方因情緒過度激動，訪問需要一度中斷，氣氛極為緊張。</p>\n<h2>暗角斷正激烈擁吻 許家傑Man爆護花</h2>\n<p>正當以為兩人勢成水火，攝製隊卻在暗角意外「斷正」二人激烈擁吻！當發現被偷拍，許家傑一秒切換模式，即時Man爆張開雙手為林淑敏擋鏡頭，大叫：「我保護你！」而剛才氣勢逼人的林淑敏則瞬間破功，嚇得「嘩」聲四起，在鏡頭前左閃右避，最後更拋下許家傑，連褸都未穿好便狼狽閃人，前後反差極大，場面非常惹笑。</p>\n<h2>網民熱議反差萌 笑言TVB識玩</h2>\n<p>影片曝光後，網民反應極為熱烈，紛紛對這對CP的新火花表示期待。不少人留言大讚宣傳片有創意：「笑死，慌張西望！TVB好識玩！」、「呢個反差太大了吧！好期待！」、「送水輝變霸總，大小姐都係咁霸氣！」、「終於唔係送水輝同大小姐，有新鮮感！」、「見到佢哋鬧交仲好笑過以前談情！」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_11141402826afbe1051019a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"愛回家之三代同糖 林淑敏 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_11141402826afbe1051019a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_16029829216afbe10a3a86a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"愛回家之三代同糖 林淑敏 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_16029829216afbe10a3a86a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_5716231506afbe1114d10b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"愛回家之三代同糖 林淑敏 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_5716231506afbe1114d10b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_20250703866afbe12655f92.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"愛回家之三代同糖 林淑敏 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_20250703866afbe12655f92.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_17012619616afbe1387fa20.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"愛回家之三代同糖 林淑敏 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_17012619616afbe1387fa20.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_4330046446afbe148158d2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"愛回家之三代同糖 林淑敏 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_4330046446afbe148158d2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_14266357046afbe14f0ea48.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"愛回家之三代同糖 林淑敏 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_14266357046afbe14f0ea48.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_21061575116afbe1541ba5b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"愛回家之三代同糖 林淑敏 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_21061575116afbe1541ba5b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_8722436766afbe1584a5d5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"愛回家之三代同糖 林淑敏 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_8722436766afbe1584a5d5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_8186102866afbe15c72a9f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"愛回家之三代同糖 林淑敏 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_8186102866afbe15c72a9f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22a_14568625066afbe16000a3e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"愛回家之三代同糖 林淑敏 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22a_14568625066afbe16000a3e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_1647222106afbe16445e6d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"愛回家之三代同糖 林淑敏 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_1647222106afbe16445e6d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T05:49:25.834961+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1135,"images":12,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T05:30:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T06:02:36.824843+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T05:42:37.202417+00:00","content_hash":"feb8a3c68905e235e2a1fbe5f9dd56036fa8d233f9aff18e5303883486edecc1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}